documentation_complete: true

title: 'DAC Audit Rules for Users Suffice'

description: |-
    Whether the audit rules for the permission and attribute changes of
    users (auid 1000 and above) suffice where a rule also asks for rules
    for root (auid 0). The CIS Benchmarks list the rules for users only.

type: boolean

operator: equals

interactive: false

options:
    default: false
    false: false
    true: true
